            "answer": "<p>Our wooden maps are crafted from high-quality materials that will last for years with proper care. Avoid placing in direct sunlight for extended periods, and dust regularly with a soft, dry cloth. For deeper cleaning, use a slightly damp cloth and immediately dry afterward.</p>",
