          "settings": {
            "question": "What materials are used in your 3D wooden maps?",
            "answer": "<p>Our 3D wooden maps are crafted from sustainable birch plywood. Each layer is precision-cut using advanced laser technology to ensure accurate geographical representation. The maps are finished with eco-friendly stains and sealants that enhance the natural wood grain while protecting the piece.</p>",
