          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer custom map designs?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! We offer custom map designs for special locations not in our standard collection. Whether it's your hometown, a meaningful vacation spot, or a business location, we can create a personalized wooden map. Contact our customer service team with your request, and we'll provide a quote based on the complexity and size of the design.</p>",
