          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your return policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer a 30-day satisfaction guarantee on all standard products. If you're not completely satisfied, you can return your purchase for a full refund or exchange. Custom orders are non-refundable but may be eligible for store credit if there are manufacturing defects. Please note that return shipping costs are the responsibility of the customer unless the item arrived damaged.</p>",
            "category": "Returns"
